march to the Supreme Court, where they raged against the prime minister=E2=
=80=99s strongman tactics and efforts to chip away at India=E2=80=99s democ=
racy by removing millions of names from voter rolls.</span></p><p style=3D"=
font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>Why w=
ould Modi=E2=80=99s government go to such enormous lengths to crack down on=
 protests by a youth movement but let one by the opposition go forward=3F I=
t might seem like a puzzle, until you appreciate =E2=80=94 as Mujib points =
out =E2=80=94 that it=E2=80=99s part of a strategy that Modi has adopted in=
 the aftermath of this summer=E2=80=99s protests.</span></p><p style=3D"fon=
t:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>Modi is =
deliberately trying to make the ongoing demonstrations less about the youth=
 movement that unleashed them, and more about his traditional opposition.</=
span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:=
0 0 15px"><span>Because that=E2=80=99s a fight he knows how to win.</span><=
