by surprise.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;colo=
r:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>Modi tried to contain the protests, first wit=
h police batons and tear gas, then with social media videos trying to conne=
ct with Gen Z, in its own style. It didn=E2=80=99t work. In the end, he had=
 to sacrifice his education minister.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17p=
x/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>It was a </span><a h=
ref=3D"https://nl.nytimes.com/f/newsletter/44_b_b5aGhKsICDx24Kpgg~~/AAAAARA=
